<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Stora raised at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Stora raised at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry group Stora AB was raised to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market underperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
